WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.548
COBOL for Nova, from Swipht Group.

00:02.548 --> 00:13.416
Open a COBOL program in fixed or free format, and Nova highlights it, including embedded SQL, with a symbol list for divisions, sections, and paragraphs.

00:13.416 --> 00:16.931
Completions follow your COPY statements into copybooks.

00:16.931 --> 00:23.464
Jump to definitions, find references, rename names, and see a record's offsets and lengths.

00:23.464 --> 00:28.954
Save, and GnuCOBOL checks your code, so errors appear right in the editor.

00:28.954 --> 00:33.041
Build, run, and debug from the GnuCOBOL tasks.

00:33.041 --> 00:35.350
It needs Nova 11 or later.

00:35.350 --> 00:39.080
Find COBOL in the Nova Extension Library.

